Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.44,0:00:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on a journey out to see the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.28,0:00:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,While I'm on my own, I've\Nyet to reach the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.30,0:00:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So won't you come along with me right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.18,0:00:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely then we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.86,0:00:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me now as we\Njourney on from sea to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.02,0:00:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,For that treasure known\Nby everybody as One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.44,0:00:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though they laugh and\Nsay it's just a fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.68,0:00:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We are going, there's no doubt we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.94,0:00:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we can feel the\Nrush of energy overcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It will lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep pretending that you know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Books will only get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:01:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No guides for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.14,0:01:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not worry soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.52,0:01:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The rain will be gone with the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.08,0:01:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your chin up, raise the anchor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's what you'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.71,0:01:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it time and calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.86,0:01:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The storm that you have built within.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.38,0:01:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and have my board at number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.48,0:01:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Once tomorrow's wind picks up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.62,0:01:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We set stuff cause we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.86,0:01:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thresh it up, stand tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.98,0:01:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And take a look at one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.36,0:01:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All the journey makes\Nme want to see somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.74,0:01:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There are things out there\Nyou just won't believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.40,0:01:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.68,0:01:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.38,0:01:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.48,0:01:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.88,0:01:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Most will believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.80,0:01:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.12,0:01:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.32,0:01:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I am on a journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.84,0:01:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Out to see the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.40,0:01:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't all on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.40,0:01:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got my group of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Together we've got our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.44,0:01:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Says your captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.10,0:01:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who says it can't be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.36,0:01:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't even tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.02,0:01:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta just believe we'll\Nmake it to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.02,0:01:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanna do it all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.66,0:02:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Together surely we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.90,0:02:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.80,0:02:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.18,0:02:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take this moment in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.82,0:02:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.14,0:02:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.52,0:02:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take this feeling in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.24,0:02:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.56,0:02:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.74,0:02:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.12,0:02:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't find any documents related\Nto their trafficking deals.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.94,0:02:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Too convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.48,0:02:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously, somebody made off with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.02,0:02:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.84,0:02:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the same story on my end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.86,0:02:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All the weapons and explosives that were\Nleft behind disappeared just as quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.10,0:02:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It was no small amount, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.30,0:02:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy was panicked, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.68,0:02:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Must have been a large organization.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.34,0:02:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Like the Revolutionary Army?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.56,0:03:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That seems likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.28,0:03:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, it's time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.28,0:03:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Palik.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.24,0:03:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite the nuisance, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.04,0:03:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't agree more, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.58,0:03:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost as irksome as you. Ha-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.66,0:03:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.57,0:03:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Sticking it to him, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.92,0:03:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the question is, where\Nis Straw Hat going next?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.08,0:03:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a land of tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.40,0:03:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,One that was beset by dark strings,\Npulling its history in woeful directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.92,0:03:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And when the tragedies\Npiled up too high to count,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.82,0:03:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,what could they do but drown out\Ntheir sorrows with the sound of music?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.48,0:03:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The sound of guitar, of feet\Nstomping, of hands clapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.18,0:04:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Until at last, the curtain\Nfalls on this long performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.30,0:04:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A tragedy with no name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.68,0:04:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,As the music goes silent,\Nthe truth rings out clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.26,0:04:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The king has returned, and the path it\Nstretches out before them is one of peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.84,0:04:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like to propose\Na suggestion to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.90,0:04:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.24,0:04:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose that's the\Ncue to introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.54,0:04:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Gancho, Chief Donut.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.82,0:04:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing next to me here is my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.32,0:04:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My name's Moncherry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.86,0:04:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,She's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.26,0:04:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You want us to make this?\NIs that right? Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.14,0:04:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a real important job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.64,0:05:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The Referee World Summit is this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.48,0:05:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming soon, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.80,0:05:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd better get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.24,0:05:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't be left behind, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.24,0:05:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.50,0:05:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca said she'll be stopping by early\Nthis afternoon to cook some lunch for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.00,0:05:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so? And Course?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.60,0:05:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, he's coming too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.70,0:05:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.60,0:05:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems we'll have the whole\Nfamily together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.08,0:05:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.34,0:05:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,In the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.80,0:05:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,those who come to visit\Nthis kingdom will be
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.22,0:05:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,met with a surprise like\Nnone other in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.86,0:05:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I get a hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.06,0:05:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you look who it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.92,0:05:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca and Monterey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.24,0:05:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Alongside the humans of the city, Tiny\NTomtata can be found living and thriving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.10,0:05:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, shouldn't we focus on\Nbuilding houses first? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.12,0:05:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our first priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.32,0:06:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Such an adorable sight may turn\Ninto a tourist attraction itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.02,0:06:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a kingdom of love,\Npassion, and fairies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.62,0:06:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess the statues are\Nimportant too. That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.58,0:06:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.62,0:06:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we finish transporting the\Nprisoner, I'll be heading on a journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.02,0:06:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,A journey?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.06,0:06:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't set foot inside\Nany Navy base. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.40,0:06:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Not unless I turn in Straw Hat and Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.68,0:06:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.40,0:06:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is apologize and\Nthen Sakazuki can save face easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.88,0:06:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.46,0:06:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.06,0:06:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I want to save face too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.42,0:07:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, fine. Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.40,0:07:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Fujitora.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.62,0:07:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, Tsuru,\Nthat man's an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.24,0:07:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He had one last chance\Nto do the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.20,0:07:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,To side with me and eliminate all of those
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.28,0:07:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,brats before they caused any more trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.54,0:07:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now look at where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.24,0:07:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I was holding the reins, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.64,0:07:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The reins on all the monsters\Nthat threaten this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.46,0:07:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking me down was a terrible mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.16,0:07:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.56,0:07:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll regret this decision soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.06,0:07:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really believe the crap\Nthat comes out of your mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.30,0:07:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so delusional.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.82,0:07:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything would have worked out if\Nonly we'd helped you, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.48,0:08:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we didn't, so you can deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.00,0:08:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over, and you lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.38,0:08:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you really aren't going\Nto give an inch, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.80,0:08:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It takes a thief to know one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.02,0:08:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So what do you think will happen\Nto the world of pirates now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.94,0:08:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me answer that question\Nwith one of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.30,0:08:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think happens\Nto monsters once they've
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.08,0:08:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,lost their source of food\Nand are off their leashes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.16,0:08:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anyone who rules these\Nseas who can reign them in?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.14,0:08:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Who possesses the most power, the\Nmost influence in these waters?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.14,0:08:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the four emperors, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.40,0:08:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Or the seven warlords\Nwho struck a clever deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.90,0:08:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe the brats from the\Nworst generation running wild?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.20,0:08:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.14,0:09:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, we can't ignore the Navy,\Nswinging around their hammer of justice,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.54,0:09:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,or the formidable fighters\Nof the Revolutionary Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.62,0:09:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,who struggle fearlessly\Nfor the common man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.80,0:09:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Or will those with the will of D\Nwalk in the shadows of history?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.70,0:09:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,When and where will they\Ndecide to show themselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.28,0:09:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's gonna side with who?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.32,0:09:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who will betray who?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.28,0:09:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a message for you\Nto give the celestial.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.76,0:09:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragons in Marie Joie tell them they\Nwill be dragged from their gilded halls.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.26,0:09:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been 25 years since gold Roger\Nconquered the Grand Line and no one's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.16,0:09:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,done it since his rival White Beard\Nstood before the throne but met his end,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.72,0:09:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,having never sat upon it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.38,0:09:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So what happens now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.04,0:09:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You think there are more pirates\Nrunning wild out there than ever before,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.40,0:09:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's just one empty seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.72,0:09:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.88,0:10:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All those pirates are about to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.08,0:10:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,have a struggle for supremacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.68,0:10:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The mask is burning!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.62,0:10:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Put it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.50,0:10:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we headed to Impel Down?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.84,0:10:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, I have a small request.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.18,0:10:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to bring me\Na newspaper every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.10,0:10:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Then at least I'll never be bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.10,0:10:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like four Navy ships, but it's wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.56,0:10:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got so many heavy hitters,\Neven though this is just a transfer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.68,0:10:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough strength\Nto crush a whole country.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.66,0:10:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not taking\Nchances with Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.12,0:10:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, bad news, Master Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.32,0:10:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we can't get Joker.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.16,0:10:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we turn around? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.18,0:11:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me what I can't\Ndo, you piece of crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.78,0:11:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.78,0:11:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like this at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.58,0:11:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like your ship has more\NLuffy on it than ours does.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.36,0:11:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so flattered that it stinks so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.94,0:11:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.10,0:11:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something on this ship\Nmore exciting than anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.18,0:11:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And this fever cod here\Nis showing us the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.74,0:11:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the real Mr. Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.56,0:11:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's truly an honor to\Nhave you here, Mr. Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.94,0:11:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I never imagined my wildest\Ndreams would come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.16,0:11:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He's shining so brightly I can't even see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.12,0:11:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a real struggle. I gotta tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.92,0:11:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all families, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.24,0:12:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Funny how everything worked\Nout with the Vivi card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.02,0:12:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we have Sabo to thank for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.08,0:12:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, this is a fever card of Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.56,0:12:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I had one made up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.36,0:12:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,When did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.26,0:12:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be taking a piece\Nas well, hell yeah! Mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.72,0:12:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabo is the man!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.90,0:12:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the perfect big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.48,0:12:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Strong and nice—listen, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.76,0:12:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna be your\Nfollower like the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.48,0:12:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.42,0:12:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take a piece just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.24,0:12:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine by me; should\Nbe enough for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.62,0:12:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.86,0:12:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,like it's farewell for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.76,0:12:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll meet again soon, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.52,0:12:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No doubt in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.14,0:12:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Until next time—Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.86,0:12:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,See you guys. Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.66,0:12:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, that
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.64,0:12:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,was one heck of a party, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.80,0:12:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Those guys really grew on me, Bartholomew!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.46,0:12:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop wasting time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.12,0:12:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,wasting time
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.08,0:12:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.99,0:12:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't take quarters from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.00,0:13:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We should hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.90,0:13:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course! On it, Mr. Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.64,0:13:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard the man! Straight for Zo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.18,0:13:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Full speed ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.60,0:13:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.34,0:13:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if the rest of the crew\Nmade it safely to the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.66,0:13:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami was with them, so I know\Nthey didn't lose their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.54,0:13:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But if Big Mom catches them,\Nthat could be bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.78,0:13:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It worries me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.92,0:13:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.28,0:13:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm reading the paper, and it looks\Nlike our bounties just went up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.62,0:13:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.53,0:13:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see it! Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.22,0:13:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you already knew!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.40,0:13:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Incidentally, I have\Nyour posters in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.74,0:13:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Come this way! Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.70,0:13:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You were ready for this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.46,0:13:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I threw yours away, but your\Nbounty's up to 500 million. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.10,0:13:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.44,0:13:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really care about that crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.34,0:13:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, gaze upon your own glory!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.48,0:13:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You framed them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.62,0:13:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, along with the\Nautographs you gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.24,0:13:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall we begin?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.00,0:14:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,First of all, Straw Hat\NLuffy, 500 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.98,0:14:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm getting up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.92,0:14:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Next up is Pirate Hunter\NZoro, 320 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.80,0:14:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.86,0:14:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we celebrate with a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.52,0:14:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Demon child, Nico Robin,\N130 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.94,0:14:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, it's gone up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.72,0:14:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,cyborg Franky 94 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.20,0:14:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So close to a hundred!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.44,0:14:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, that's general Franky, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.48,0:14:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on! Who's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.70,0:14:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,200 million. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.04,0:14:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They actually got my\Nface and name this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.62,0:14:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They're coming for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.60,0:14:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Put that bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.98,0:14:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with that awful picture, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.84,0:14:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.75,0:14:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell, bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.02,0:14:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is your bounty so\Nhigh and mine so low? Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.52,0:14:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Even my own crewmates are coming for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.40,0:15:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to be 100 million, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.20,0:15:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all more than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.22,0:15:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.22,0:15:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's look at the rest of them first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.04,0:15:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackfoot Sanji, 177 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.66,0:15:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's not that weird\Ndrawing anymore. He'll be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.42,0:15:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Tch, this one sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.24,0:15:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can't laugh at him anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.44,0:15:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Cat Boigler Nami, 66 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.64,0:15:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,She posed for her picture again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.64,0:15:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,When did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.18,0:15:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Cotton Candy Lover Chopper, 100.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.94,0:15:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I don't want to be the\None to break the news to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.64,0:15:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So, oh, King Brook.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.36,0:15:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,83 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.30,0:15:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just one of his show posters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.06,0:15:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell? Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.84,0:15:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of yous, like Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.28,0:15:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, made a pretty\Nbig splash in Dressrosa,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.72,0:15:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,so your bounties went up a whole bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.62,0:15:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But everyone else across the\Nboard went up by 50 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.92,0:16:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That goes for all the\Nfolks on my crew, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.18,0:16:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.80,0:16:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I noticed something weird\Nabout Mr. Sanji's poster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.22,0:16:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though he didn't see much\Naction, his bounty went way up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.16,0:16:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, look at the text.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.46,0:16:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.37,0:16:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Only alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.29,0:16:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.38,0:16:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hail!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.72,0:16:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful, guys. They're huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.04,0:16:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It smashed the whole rank\Nthrough the deck! Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.94,0:16:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupi, get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.04,0:16:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And everyone else, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.52,0:16:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.72,0:16:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.26,0:16:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So, but you're returning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.16,0:16:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's your navigator?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.46,0:16:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What do they advise?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.92,0:16:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.52,0:16:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing is, we're land\Npirates, so they got one?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.54,0:16:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.45,0:16:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the new world, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.86,0:16:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, Garp!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.60,0:16:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sup, Granny?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.88,0:16:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you got a minute to tell\Nme what you know about Hale?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.66,0:16:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,See, when we're in trouble, his grandma\Nalways knows what to do and bails us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.28,0:16:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.19,0:16:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You do have someone competent to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.80,0:17:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a hot tip!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.66,0:17:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Know that pile of chewing gum?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.22,0:17:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The one stuck to the ship's deck?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.90,0:17:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.81,0:17:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No one could get it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.02,0:17:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,She said to grab some hail, wrap it in\Na hanky, and freeze the gum with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.18,0:17:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.38,0:17:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.74,0:17:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It came right up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.65,0:17:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what she said!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.76,0:17:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But we're in danger! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.68,0:17:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.59,0:17:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't help!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.72,0:17:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, Granny says sugar that lump!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.20,0:17:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough of her full wisdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.26,0:17:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.30,0:17:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship's going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.50,0:17:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Help us, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.18,0:17:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We just had to choose this one! Typical.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.78,0:17:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess it's up to us to fix this. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.38,0:17:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I had to Sunny's equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.88,0:17:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.36,0:17:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong? Barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.84,0:17:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's just Granny said,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.02,0:17:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,if you get in nature's way,\Nthen you'll pay the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.42,0:17:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Live on land, you damn\Nchicken. Come on. For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.82,0:17:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You see this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.04,0:17:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We're so blessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.20,0:18:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't fear no forces in nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.36,0:18:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They're unshakable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.88,0:18:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Our appreciation rains down on hail.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.96,0:18:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell are you all still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.54,0:18:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.54,0:18:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something, idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.40,0:18:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The AO pirates, formerly Whitebeard's\Nmen, have been wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.56,0:18:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it him again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.74,0:18:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the warlord, Edward Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.70,0:18:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,More pirates who worked\Nunder Whitebeard, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.16,0:18:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Remind me, how many captains\Nhas he put down in all?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.76,0:18:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sixteen now, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.64,0:18:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.90,0:18:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,First they have some sort of disagreement,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.90,0:18:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,then he takes them out along\Nwith whatever town they're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.88,0:18:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,As usual, he leaves a big mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.82,0:18:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,In addition to the collateral damage,\Nthe death tolls at about six hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.26,0:18:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He may be a warlord, but we can't\Nexactly turn a blind eye here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.36,0:18:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's quite the quandary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.10,0:18:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just that, but Weevil also claims to\Nbe the biological son of Edward Newgate,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.86,0:18:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,though not too many people are buying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.54,0:19:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.45,0:19:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, whether or not it's the\Ntruth is of no consequence to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.00,0:19:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Lineage aside, he does\Nhave one valuable trait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.62,0:19:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Edward Weevil is a\Ntremendously powerful pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.64,0:19:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, he's just like\NWhitebeard was as a young man,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.98,0:19:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,in terms of his physical strength at least\Nthough that's all they have in common
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.10,0:19:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,a week after departing dress rosa it's\Ntoo foggy i can't see a damn thing
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.38,0:19:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How are all of you seasick and you\Ncall yourselves a pirate crew? Gum-Gum
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.46,0:19:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,my granny always told me chewing gum\Nsoothes the tummy are you kidding
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.22,0:19:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Me is that why the whole ship is\Ncovered in it. These guys are great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.18,0:19:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,hey boss i think i see something
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.72,0:19:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,at two o 'clock be more specific man
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.58,0:20:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,it's hard to make out it could be a\Nmountain or a monster if you can't tell
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.40,0:20:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,then either you need an eye exam or\Nwe're in big trouble it's really slow
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.44,0:20:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm pretty sure it's on the move.\NMaybe you just drunk a moving mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.72,0:20:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,let's go see are you crazy here's a\Nthought how about we get out of this foggy
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.26,0:20:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,maze asap if we get something we'll be\Ncapsized hang on god oh you don't have
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.20,0:20:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,to call me god that's so nice must be
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.92,0:20:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,the 200 million huh with a bounty like
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.56,0:20:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,that i'm sure the navy's hot on your
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.72,0:20:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,trail now let's see looks like the veaver
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.12,0:20:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,card is pointing that way whoa you're\Nright must mean your friends are there
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.98,0:20:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear, do you need some gum too? You\Nlook ill. I've been trying not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.94,0:21:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,think about that they say Zoe is\Nnaturally resistant to invaders because
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.48,0:21:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,of the fog and the strong current\Nwe've got a headwind to taking the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.24,0:21:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,sails let's row this baby forward
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.20,0:21:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,come on you can do better than that
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.46,0:21:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, are you sure\Nthis is Oh Oh Danny right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.96,0:21:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,then we should leave turn\Nthe sticky ship around
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.52,0:21:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,we're here believe it
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.36,0:21:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Or not. Uh
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.88,0:21:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,traffic
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.76,0:21:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,i don't
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.67,0:21:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,think that's an island\Nlooks more like an animal
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.82,0:21:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah the land of zo rests on the\Nback of a giant elephant What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.36,0:22:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,How the heck does that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.64,0:22:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,As the beast moves around,\Nthose coordinates change.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.88,0:22:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's called a phantom island.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.50,0:22:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you can't use\Na log post to get to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.24,0:22:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my first time here as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.70,0:22:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Since it's showing it's back to us,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.68,0:22:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,that might mean Blackfoot's group\Ngot here long before we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.04,0:22:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So all this time, it's been\Nsteadily moving away from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.64,0:22:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.55,0:22:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get ready to disembark.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.50,0:22:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you guys spare us some of your food?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.68,0:22:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Not for you, freeloader.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.34,0:22:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.72,0:22:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's for Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.00,0:22:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, take all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.74,0:22:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.68,0:22:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is Zo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.56,0:22:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly, there are countless wonders\Nto be found outside our country.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.96,0:22:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope Momonosuke is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.66,0:22:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I've heard that the\Ninhabitants of Zo are hostile.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.04,0:22:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.66,0:22:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They're called the Minks\Nfor a thousand years.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.26,0:22:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All humans have been banned here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.98,0:23:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So this place has been\Naround for that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.14,0:23:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, that means the elephant's\Nlike a thousand years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.02,0:23:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is too good to be true!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.34,0:23:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you chill out?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.64,0:23:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.72,0:23:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.28,0:23:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship that carries\NStraw Hats everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.28,0:23:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So they can spread awesomeness\Nall over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.66,0:23:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The thousand suns as I live and breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.60,0:23:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I do to deserve such an honor?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.22,0:23:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Please
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.76,0:23:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not working!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.67,0:23:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.64,0:23:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.55,0:24:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So they did make it to Zoe before we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.30,0:24:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and it looks like they got\Naway from Big Mom safely, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.04,0:24:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see any major damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.76,0:24:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.42,0:24:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.96,0:24:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper! Brook!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.58,0:24:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.82,0:24:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And, uh, that guy with the gas!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.42,0:24:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Strawheads!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.68,0:24:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta cross over!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.06,0:24:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.54,0:24:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, no need to wait\Nfor an invitation from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.30,0:24:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.48,0:24:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure they left. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.14,0:24:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they got here early.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.70,0:24:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, be careful out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.72,0:24:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're coming too, moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.48,0:24:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could tag along.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.24,0:24:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just so I could bask in the\Nwarmth of their greatness.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.90,0:24:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,for a little bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.08,0:24:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm sure a regular\Nguy like me would only
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.46,0:24:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,get in the way of their godlike adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.08,0:24:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.04,0:24:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Our happiness providence\Nalready backs out anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.26,0:24:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You will never be cool enough\Nto join the Straw Hat Pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.60,0:24:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,but I swear the next time we see you guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.20,0:25:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll have abilities that'll make\Nus worthy of being called servants.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.78,0:25:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,of the Straw Hats at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.48,0:25:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and if we help you again, can we\Nplease have a little something in return?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.52,0:25:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The other four autographs\Nfrom the rest of the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.96,0:25:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I missed out on meeting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.76,0:25:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's kind of a big ask, but we'd\Nbe so proud if we owed the whole set.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.34,0:25:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,A worm?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.38,0:25:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Or a snake?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.54,0:25:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got legs. I say listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.46,0:25:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They're ignoring me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.82,0:25:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like I'm not even here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.54,0:25:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They're so focused on the job in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.18,0:25:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.82,0:25:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.12,0:25:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of my finest work, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.84,0:25:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.54,0:25:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A snake, I told you. What? A snake?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.52,0:25:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you certain?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.10,0:25:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.12,0:25:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.88,0:25:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Up here, rising dragon. Dragon? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.50,0:26:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.74,0:26:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.76,0:26:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is going to be so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.90,0:26:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.52,0:26:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, dragons aren't\Nsupposed to be wimpy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.72,0:26:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Really now?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.82,0:26:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,An eye for an eye, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.48,0:26:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.34,0:26:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Make haste, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.00,0:26:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Climb upon it so that we might be\Ncarried upward. So it can't fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.74,0:26:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.65,0:26:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.14,0:27:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Big Eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.38,0:27:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How much further do we have to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.32,0:27:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even see the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.88,0:27:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure you got the right giant elephant?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.12,0:27:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.38,0:27:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The Viva card's still pointing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.82,0:27:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.10,0:27:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Dragon, do your stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.32,0:27:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Romeo!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.40,0:27:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for bringing us here!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.50,0:27:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You and your crew were a big help!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.40,0:27:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He sank, but I think he said...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.36,0:27:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He almost called me by my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.36,0:27:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy for you, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.46,0:27:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.50,0:27:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, the pleasure was all ours. Please\Nbe careful on your new adventure, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.44,0:27:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Same to you, booty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.80,0:27:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.08,0:27:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the happiest day of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.12,0:28:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Having said their farewells.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.04,0:28:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The crew continued their climb to the\Ntop of the phantom island of Zola.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.78,0:28:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, rebel forces are\Nwinning all across the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.14,0:28:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Clearly, the defeat of the Don Quixote\Nfamily had a significant impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.50,0:28:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,With all these nations involved in\Nweapon trafficking, I'm not surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.14,0:28:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.28,0:28:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But, tell the men not to get\Ntoo comfortable. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.96,0:28:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The world government won't have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.68,0:28:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And Cypher-Pol's been\Nreinforced in recent years.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.98,0:28:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we need to stay on our guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.28,0:28:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.70,0:28:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.20,0:28:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The weapons we brought from Dressrosa,\Nthey found a special metal inside them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.08,0:28:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.24,0:29:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called drunken iron ore.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.02,0:29:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a few countries can\Nmine it, so it's really rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.80,0:29:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means we might be able to find\Nout where the weapons were first made.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.70,0:29:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's excellent news, then. Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.52,0:29:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And you brought our lost\Ncomrades back as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.40,0:29:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done some impressive\Nwork. Who me? Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.30,0:29:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabo and Luffy helped out a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.42,0:29:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Any news about Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.52,0:29:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard she was caught in Sabo Odi,\Nbut it turned out that wasn't true.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.34,0:29:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,She's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.25,0:29:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, she seems really full of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.32,0:29:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.23,0:29:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, don't you want\Nto know about Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.16,0:29:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already heard enough. Oh, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.40,0:29:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabo gave you the full report huh anyway
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.26,0:29:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Koala yes we need to ask for help from
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.74,0:29:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,them them sir go summon the leaders
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.42,0:30:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,of the revolutionary army from all\Nover the world right oh geez it's gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.82,0:30:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,get intense with all of them together
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.30,0:30:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,though
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.21,0:30:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,yes
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.24,0:30:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,this is
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.15,0:30:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Lafitte, it's purchase.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.08,0:30:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear me? Purchase, yes. Of course, we\Nwent to Dressrosa to pick you up, but you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.46,0:30:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't there, yeah?\NSorry, I was out cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.76,0:30:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,for a while there so\NI couldn't contact you
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.76,0:30:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,well how do you like that bastard was\Nalive so what have you been up to all of
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.60,0:30:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,this time where are you now
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.50,0:30:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.58,0:30:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,stowed
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.49,0:30:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,away I snuck down into the bottom of a
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.52,0:31:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.43,0:31:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell Captain Teach something for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.12,0:31:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If we invade this place, we'll be up\Nto our eyeballs and free weapons easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.46,0:31:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've told you countless times.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.10,0:31:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Commodore Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.56,0:31:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And make sure to send Doc Q, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.88,0:31:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm at death's doorstep over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.52,0:31:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Burgess, enough of this. Tell us where
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.86,0:31:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.77,0:31:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what the place is called,\Nbut it's some uncharted island.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.64,0:31:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just follow my lead. Make\Nit quick. Dragons here too,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.98,0:31:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and so is that pain in the ass named Sabo?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.78,0:31:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.04,0:31:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.02,0:31:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where the Revolutionary\NArmy's headquarters are.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.84,0:32:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does everybody have to be\Nsuch big, stupid, dumb jerks?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.00,0:32:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't stop telling those\Nmean lies and making me mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.66,0:32:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The only sons that Whitebeard ever had\Nwere the Whitebeard Pirate, they all say.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.38,0:32:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy! Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.00,0:32:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They're wrong, because\NWhitebeard is my daddy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.32,0:32:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My beard's white, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.66,0:32:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course my treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.42,0:32:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Those Whitebeard Pirates\Nwere never a real family.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.14,0:32:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard was the strongest\Npirate in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.78,0:32:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and you're the only\Nbiological son he ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.46,0:32:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.72,0:32:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I was his one true lover.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.00,0:32:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So hold your head high, sweet son of mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.74,0:32:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They're giving me a boo-boo.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.26,0:32:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.96,0:32:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,A mirror?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.32,0:33:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.30,0:33:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a picture of Whitebeard. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.12,0:33:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But it looks just like me, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.02,0:33:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly the point I'm\Ntrying to make you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.28,0:33:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You two couldn't look more alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.20,0:33:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.11,0:33:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm stupid, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.16,0:33:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.60,0:33:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.84,0:33:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, you're my precious boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.14,0:33:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.74,0:33:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.10,0:33:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, can you tell\NMommy what your job is?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.44,0:33:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.92,0:33:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.62,0:33:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,First, you have to track down who's\Nleft of the Whitebeard Pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.26,0:33:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,like Marco the Phoenix, for instance?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.28,0:33:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and then you take what's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.64,0:33:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Edward Newgate must have left\Nbehind a substantial fortune,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.88,0:33:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and as his only descendant, the\Nentirety of said fortune belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.34,0:33:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, right. Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.52,0:33:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.12,0:34:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.42,0:34:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Money's OK, but what I\Nreally want is revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.54,0:34:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackbeard's going to\Npay for killing my daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.90,0:34:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive that big bully.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.70,0:34:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to beat him up\Ntill he's caught at 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.78,0:34:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Foolish boy, where's the\Nsense in getting even?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.60,0:34:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't pay the bills\Nwith revenge, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.58,0:34:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What we need is money.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.02,0:34:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and claim what belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.32,0:34:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mommy, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.74,0:34:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What does the newspaper say?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.34,0:34:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo just got taken out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.50,0:34:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that brat again, Carp's grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.00,0:34:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They say Marco and the others protected\Nhim during the Battle of Marineford.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.94,0:34:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he knows where to find Marco.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.92,0:34:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go pummel him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.60,0:35:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.00,0:35:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Chairman Buggy! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.08,0:35:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The snails are ringing off the\Nhook with new job requests.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.82,0:35:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.18,0:35:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that nobody can get weapons\Nfrom Doflamingo anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.00,0:35:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone's looking to\Nhire pirate mercenaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.84,0:35:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,to take care of all\Ntheir fighting for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.76,0:35:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We've taken over the military market.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.74,0:35:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just what I like to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.06,0:35:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.90,0:35:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as you're finished eating,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.88,0:35:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to get out there and\Npillage to your heart's content.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.28,0:35:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, it's legitimate now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.58,0:35:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's done in my name, that makes it the\Nlegal business of a warlord of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.24,0:36:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Buggy! Buggy! Buggy! Buggy! Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.48,0:36:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, Chairman Buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.10,0:36:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot to tell you, we got a call\Nfrom our Scales mercenary, Hirudin.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.42,0:36:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He says he wants to quit. He what?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.74,0:36:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not a huge loss\Nif it's only one giant.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.74,0:36:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We still got four others, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.72,0:36:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all of them. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.70,0:36:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's the most\Nlucrative group we've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.04,0:36:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would they quit just when\Nwe're starting to get busy?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.12,0:36:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think you want to know. Try me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.14,0:36:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Spit it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.42,0:36:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't see to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.18,0:36:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how Sanji and\Nthem made it up that high.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.74,0:36:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think maybe they didn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.90,0:37:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolf and the others are\Nscaling the left leg of the
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.80,0:37:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,gargantuan beast by riding on the\Nback of another strange thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.38,0:37:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We're so high! I'm terrified!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.88,0:37:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And my arms are giving out!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.46,0:37:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate this!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.42,0:37:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.90,0:37:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He's doing the best he can!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.08,0:37:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Kine-man, Kanjuro, why did the two of\Nyou want to go to Zo in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.12,0:37:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, we haven't said.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.08,0:37:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in your debt, so the least\Nwe can do is tell you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.16,0:38:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's a complicated matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.50,0:38:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, though Zo has been our destination\Never since we first departed, Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.98,0:38:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, I can tell you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.22,0:38:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Firstly, we are concerned\Nabout Momonosuke's well-being.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.04,0:38:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We also hope to be reunited\Nwith our friend Raizo,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.68,0:38:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,a ninja who was separated from us at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.04,0:38:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A ninja?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.34,0:38:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A real ninja? Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.72,0:38:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.04,0:38:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.18,0:38:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Look up there, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.66,0:38:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's falling toward us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.32,0:38:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.02,0:38:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That came out of nowhere.
